window.bookSummaryJSON = "A body is found in the attic of a fabulous Long Island estate.<br>There is a claw print scorched into the wall, and the stench of sulfur chokes the air.<br>When FBI Special Agent Pendergast investigates the gruesome crime, he discovers that thirty years ago four men conjured something <i>unspeakable</i>.<br>Has the devil come to claim his due?<br>Some things can't be undone."; 
